The `/provision` endpoint checks if `provision_state` is set to an active status (anything other than `'ready'` or `'failed'`). If so, it immediately returns:
```json
{
  "ok": false,
  "error": "Provision already in progress (<status>)"
}
```

The allowed statuses during an active run are: `resetting → creating → switching → verifying → ready/failed` (per `fixture-serve/CLAUDE.md`). New provision attempts are blocked until the current one reaches either `ready` or `failed`.

